  "text": "None whatsoever.\nNo headeaches, no ED, no bloating, no belching or any discomfort.\nI recommend it if the doctor prescribes it.\nI take one purple pill in the evening before dinner, and I sleep well with no side effects even if I have a few drinks with it.\nThe cost is high.\nPerhaps people who are making bad comments have other medical problems and Nexium may not be the best fit.\nThat is their doctor's fault, not the drug.\n",
